sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as handleLogin
    participant U as User Manager
    participant A as Auth
    participant R as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>H: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    H->>H: Decode + 非空校验
    H->>U: VerifyPassword(email, password)
    U->>DB: 查询用户并验证密码
    H->>A: SaveSession(user)
    A->>R: 保存 Session
    H->>A: SetCSRFCookie()
    H->>DB: 更新 last_login_at + activity_log
    H-->>C: 用户数据 + Session/CSRF Cookie
